idimarri", "text": "does it have a moon or crescent on it?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:13:24Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "🇳🇦", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:13:41Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Haan SA controlled Namibia until 1990", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:13:47Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "3. Its historical afterlife is unusually awkward: preserved in memory, tolerated in ceremony, and haunted by the fact that political extinction does not always erase symbolic continuity. It belonged to a Pacific sovereignty that was gradually surrounded not only by stronger powers, but by the administrative habits of incorporation. What survives now is less a state than a remembered claim to one. What is it?", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:13:49Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Jeez, why would any designer admire this", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:14:05Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Hawaii?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:14:07Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "HI flag", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:14:32Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "the state flag", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:14:39Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "with Union Jack on it", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:15:46Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Hawaii is correct", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:15:59Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Connect: Ottoman, Namibia, Hawaii", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:16:11Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "4. This attempted the ambitious task of summarizing not a people, but a theory of history. It belonged to a state that treated inherited legitimacy as obsolete and sought instead to encode class, labor, and destiny into a single civilizational shorthand. Few visual identities have so successfully made ideology look permanent. What is it?", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:16:20Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "USSR?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:16:27Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Its simple just understand the theme of quiz", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:16:30Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "China?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:16:44Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Ussr is correct", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:16:58Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "5. This belonged to a polity that relied heavily on structure, layering, and inherited order to project normalcy, even while its internal moral architecture was increasingly indefensible. It carried the weight of multiple loyalties and unresolved pasts, and when it disappeared, the change was understood as far more than cosmetic. It did not merely go out of use; it lost its right to represent. What is it?", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T16:17:25Z", "use